          </span>
          <span class="bg-green-500 text-white px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">
            Updated September 2026
          </span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-white leading-tight mb-8">
          Weslo Cadence G 5.9 <span class="text-[#5AA9FF]">Treadmill Review</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          It sold in enormous numbers by being the cheapest folding treadmill a major brand would put its name on. It has been discontinued — so this review is about what it was, what it is worth secondhand, and what replaces it.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
          <a href="#weslo-cadence-g-5-9" class="bg-[#FF5A1F] hover:bg-[#E64F16] text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-black no-underline transition-colors uppercase tracking-widest text-sm">
