          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            The Cadence G 5.9 earned its sales: it was the cheapest folding treadmill a major brand
            would stand behind, and it walked people around their spare rooms for years. It is
            <strong class="text-white">discontinued</strong>, so the only question left is what a
            used one is worth — and the answer is $150-$300, after you have run it.
          </p>
